<title>UK: UK's Alizyme plans clinical devt of 5 drugs.</title>
<headline>UK's Alizyme plans clinical devt of 5 drugs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drug research firm Alizyme Plc said on Tuesday it was making rapid progress with its drug development and expected to take up to five products into clinical development during 1998.</p>
</text>
